WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hi, Ces!
-Hi. Hi, Seth!

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:04.004 line:92%
-It's so nice to see you.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:06.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
