of who won in your category.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. I mean,
I'm a fan of everybody.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:21.187 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But I was like --

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:24.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
I joke that I was maybe
only third on my own list.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:27.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is --
We should give a shout-out

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.495 size:75% position:38%
This is Annie Murphy
of "Schitt's Creek"

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:30.730
that won in your category,
and that is a show you love.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:31.698 line:92%
-Yes. Has it been announced?

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.633 size:81% position:41%
-I think it's out now.
It's a little weird.

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
The end schedule
is weird this year.

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:37.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-This is very exciting for u

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.373
to see you because you wer
one of the last people we ha

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:43.843
in studio before everythin
went sideways back in March.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:46.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I know.
And I was talking so big.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:51.151
And I said I was going to go
to the soccer game, which I did.

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:53.953 line:92%
I went to an arena on Sunday

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:58.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the person I was with
was sick by Thursday.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:00:59.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really?
That was the Thursday

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:01.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
where everybody
basically left town, right

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:05.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Well, I quarantined
for two weeks.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:08.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You lived your best life
right up until the last minute

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:10.136 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-[ Laughs ] I sure did.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got to see
the soccer team win.

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:14.307 line:92%
The U.S. Women's National team

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:15.375 line:92%
-You had something that is

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think, on par
with that kind victory.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:19.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which is -- A lot of times
people will now --

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:22.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because they know your skill
as an impressionist,

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:24.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
they will cast you
from the public,

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:25.919 line:92%
and someone suggested you play

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:28.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don Junior's girlfriend,
Kimberly Guilfoyle,

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:30.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was Bette Midler
in a tweet.

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:35.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was the divine Miss Midler
I cannot believe it.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:40.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
I e-mailed Lorne immediately
after I saw that tweet.

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.134 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-And he responded.

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:42.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was like, "Bette Midler
said to do it, so..."

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:45.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said...
[As Lorne] "We'll get the wig.

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:46.873 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-That's so nice of him.

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:49.209 line:92%
He has such good wig contacts.

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:53.847
-Yeah. Yeah. He got his --
He's giving me one of his.

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:54.814 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh. That's nice.

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:58.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
You -- My personal favorite --
And I think I text you

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
almost every time
you do Jeanine Pirro.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:05.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is this as much fun to do
as it is to watch?

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.292 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes. Absolutely.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:12.298
And it's fun because Colin i
always a little bit surprised,

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:15.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he enjoys it so much,
being tortured.

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:19.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I feel like
that kind of woman

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:20.206 line:92%
throwing a drink on Collin

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:23.543 size:81% position:41%
is like a weird, like,
maybe fantasy of his.

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:24.410 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-[ Laughs ] Probably.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I don't want
to think about it that way

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
because it'll
change things for me.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.416
-It'll put you in your hea
the next time you do it.

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:31.317 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:32.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's kind of fun,
you know, playing her.

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:35.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then even with
Bette Midler tweeting,

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:38.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've never felt more honored
than, like,

00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:43.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
when a crazed brunette screams
on television,

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.031 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
people think of me.

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:46.065 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. That's true.

00:02:46.065 --> 00:02:48.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
If saw a crazy brunette,
I'd think, "Uh-oh.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:50.036 line:92%
You're about to get Cecily'd."

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.771 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-"That's Cecily." Yeah.

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:53.973 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think one of
the exciting things

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:56.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
about Saturday that everybody'
looking forward to

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:58.478 line:92%
is Jim Carrey's gonna be there

00:02:58.478 --> 00:03:00.046 line:92%
He's gonna be playing Joe Biden.

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:03.249 line:92%
And the last time he hosted,

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:06.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
