the Carrey Family Reunion.

00:03:06.286 --> 00:03:08.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there you are
as Fire Marshall Bill.

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:10.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
A very convincing
Fire Marshall Bill.

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:13.193 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Classic look. Yes.

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:14.227 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Was that good times?

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:18.364
-That was so cool, because
it was one of the instance

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:19.465 line:92%
that happens a lot on our show

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:22.902
where you get to meet,
like, your comedy heroes,

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:23.770 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
