00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:26.940
Doing a sketch like that,
we kind of got to show him

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.809 size:78% position:39%
And I think he really
appreciated it, too.

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:32.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Not all --
This is a little heartbreaking

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:34.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
