00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:43.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have an impression
of Idris Elba

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:45.058 line:92%
on the television show "Luther."

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:46.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. It has to be "Luther.
-Right.

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:48.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is not
an Idris Elba impression.

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:53.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is specific
to the BBC cop show "Luther.

00:03:53.967 --> 00:03:57.704
-And I wound up doing it for him
at the host dinner.

00:03:57.704 --> 00:04:00.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
