00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:07.247 size:81% position:41%
Because it's mainly --
it's a physical thing.

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:10.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-He just goes...

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:12.685 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[as John Luther] "No.

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:14.887 line:92%
You won't, though, will ya

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:16.756 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
