"So a lot of squintin'?"

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:26.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's a bad Idris.
That's --

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:29.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was playing him then,
not Luther.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:32.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said,
"Yeah, well, you're tired.

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:33.106 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Luther's tired."

00:04:33.106 --> 00:04:34.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Luther's tired.
He's a little over it.

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:36.843 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think his job is obviously
made a lot harder.

00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:39.612
-His job is freaking exhausting!
-It's exhausting.

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:40.613 line:92%
But I think I missed that,

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:43.683 size:84% position:42%
that Luther is often
sort of just working --

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:45.084 size:75% position:38% line:92%
A lot of this, yeah.

00:04:45.084 --> 00:04:47.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of working the chin
for old Luther.

00:04:47.787 --> 00:04:49.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And then I believe you were

00:04:49.489 --> 00:04:50.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
