Those were just his colleagues

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:54.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's a lot of
my impression work,

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:56.696
is just me saying the othe
names of people on the show.

00:04:56.696 --> 00:04:58.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
