00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:17.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
Go get Russell
at the pharmacy, Quentin.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:17.717 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Where is Nadine?"

00:05:17.717 --> 00:05:20.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
[Normal voice]
So, again, it's a lot of
the other characters.

00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:22.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you get asked
to do that one a lot?

00:05:22.989 --> 00:05:27.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Um, I did it once, and then
