00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:07.900
-But it's an incredible cast
-I'm so excited about this cast.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
We got --
I mean, I've been, like,

00:06:09.369 --> 00:06:12.138 size:81% position:41%
